      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "\u2022 Dynamic multi-entity graph traversal (Customers, Devices, IP Addresses, Bank Accounts, Merchants)\n\u2022 Coordinated abuse ring clustering & merchant collusion detection\n\u2022 Coincidental sharing disaggregation (prevents flagging shared household/office Wi-Fi)\n\u2022 Multi-hop relationship graph analysis for fraud botnets",
