      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1787503055608,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "\u2022 `pg-store` & `rusqlite`: Transaction history, entity graph nodes/edges, immutable audit logs\n\u2022 `nats-link`: Distributed message bus for decoupled multi-worker deployment\n\u2022 `governor-server`: Axum web server & zero-build vanilla JS live dashboard (polling 2s) at http://127.0.0.1:8080",
